\n\nNothing was left undone. `tasks.md` is unticked, nothing was committed, and the only dirty files I touched are the two named above.\n\nThe operator's next action: none from this worker. The orchestrator can mark T010 complete and continue the WG2 lane with T011.","time":{"start":1794589587657,"end":1794589591318}}}
